{"title":"Orc Grunt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 18 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (6.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=18\">Lv 18</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>7</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/8ab33e42f1eaec910c77.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/7a79d4ba8136e0732f4f.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/56bcc8be9ccc1dd691fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/8ab33e42f1eaec910c77.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 139 total, 30–77 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"silver-rapier\" title=\"Silver Rapier - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f02f4f5eda250757c7a7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Rapier</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-288.1px,-1371.1px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:253.2px;top:1370.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:300.6px;top:1320.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:387.2px;top:1370.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:359.7px;top:1356.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:242.4px;top:1373.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:364.0px;top:1332.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:274.9px;top:1349.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:295.2px;top:1347.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:310.1px;top:1370.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Antlion Hive</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"orc-grunt\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Orc: <a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a> <span class=\"muted\">(9)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\">Orc Warrior</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-shieldwall\">Orc Shieldwall</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-berserker\">Orc Berserker</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warchief\">Orc Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9c694d24818e1e184cda.webp\" alt=\"Orc Grunt\"></div><h3>Orc Grunt</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>18 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 20–21)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Orc</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>57</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>14.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>900</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>15 times